  era: "c. 1500\u20131000 BCE \xB7 Section 3 \xB7 Vedic Period \xB7 c. 1500 \u2013 600 BCE"
  title: Tribal organisation
  text: Society was organised in kin-based tribes, or jana, led by a chief called the rajan, whose main duty was to protect cattle and people. Assemblies such as the sabha and samiti advised him, and women could attend some assemblies.
